  "text": "\n         Home | VotingWorks \n             Skip to Content \n             Products \n             News \n             Code \n             Docs \n             Jobs \n             Donate \n             About \n                         Contact Us \n             Products \n             News \n             Code \n             Docs \n             Jobs \n             Donate \n             About \n                         Contact Us \nWe make election technology every American can trust. \nCertified to the modern federal standard.  The first open-source voting system ever federally certified. \nSecure \nWe test to the latest federal standard, and we perform regular third-party security testing. Software integrity is checkable in the field in 30 seconds. \nRobust \nWhen voter trust is broken, some blame \"human error\". We disagree. We've designed a voting system that can detect, prevent, and mitigate human error. \nTransparent \nOur source code and documentation are open for anyone to verify. We’re as transparent as the election officials we serve, because votes should not be counted with secret code.  \nElections with VotingWorks \nMark your ballot by hand on an easy-to-read ballot. \nUse a ballot-marking device if you need or prefer. \nCast your ballot on the fastest, most accurate tabulator. \nAudit tabulation to ensure all votes are properly counted. \nContact Us \n                                 Follow us \n                                 VotingWorks is a 501(c)(3) registered nonprofit organization \nand does not support or oppose any political candidate or party. \n ",
